#: scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27fe77b596b00533ac6d772e1cf82e6c441676fc035a5b91733a0996b0f8e06b
#. default-sha256: 957df94229a93e23f2b405aaa134143250ebd1b9f871afc84b30d6457fac95dc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The mansion sat near "
"the ocean."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫那时的「馆」位于海的附"
"近。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e279ed0b1aee3b26874735d6d5ae0354271518abe7b8185d66ee1ee2d799bb76
#. default-sha256: 040c3be870f95df51a938ccf77e360e954a364a1186d94c0ee9a793fcc54c00a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫To say it was perched upon a cliff might make it sound rather intimidating..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫虽说矗立在悬崖边的馆有一种恐怖阴森的感觉。⟪k:2⟫但正因如此，⟪k:3⟫如果从窗边远眺，⟪k:4⟫你"
"就会发现，"

#: scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c78eb28c0695a4d1ce0fc7ddbcbf23def22221fbb2247d332a239ada80e55755
#. default-sha256: 44e367d9d32739c00b8fbef5a76cf97e59779f7b4cc7fcd8d583648fbe9ee107
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but you could see the beautifully clear sea through the windows—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a glittering "
"expanse of emerald and turquoise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫晴天时的大海犹如蓝绿宝石四散开来一般美丽异常。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b775183ef18c15f8969bd528ddaf6ec3a42cddbbf9a795af5bf4286e4eca53a
#. default-sha256: 25305058b52e0c50464557d944e8d3f581c228662dedbeef51e38f5f527c3c67
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If the mansion had been in proper condition, it would have been breathtaking against "
"that backdrop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫如果宅邸保养得当的话，⟪k:2⟫宏伟的馆就会与壮阔的大海相辅相成，⟪k:3⟫令人叹为观止吧。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98a2ec7d769f4c1b8eff39f81f6c72f2a0985d7f07d6472322a41cbc2fcb6e17
#. default-sha256: 4d3fccfaa17c5c211f9f8172f9d2a80b0dd1e2ea33d9433e6a438ed257d9e2f7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even wanted to plant orange trees in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为了追求这种美景，⟪k:1⟫下仆甚至都想在庭院里种植一些橘树了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c16568aa282bb6ff33736649475fc41a9ceb48c2a6c1aeab59242225149645f
#. default-sha256: 255786d24d8cfec79db21593801d57f9667961478bff03615cbec4c6529c069b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though it was a tumultuous era, the sun still shone bright upon the land, which only served "
"to emphasize the house’s unsightliness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫虽说那时是动乱的时代，⟪k:1⟫但普照大地的太阳是如此明亮，⟪k:2⟫与之相比，⟪k:3⟫这座馆就显得凄惨多"
"了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db53ce384f339483ed003300ec54a57a6b7c9d482b3395b3ee28f2df560c8e2d
#. default-sha256: ad0d522048402b4b91c03e088eb02e72c7021f5af4e43316c09aa65017fd43e1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yes, perhaps I should give you some more background information. ⟪k:1⟫At that period in "
"time, a war had just drawn to a close."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫动乱……⟪k:1⟫是啊，⟪k:2⟫下仆的说明还不够详细呢。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫这个时代，⟪k:5⟫正好有一场刚结束不久的"
"战争。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a036709f389e11859408523e785683ba6a0ee250350188e349491947396ed3cf
#. default-sha256: b2ce70655cfe2acb49e259042b3253d32a89d1efe019aed5bba89f7a79164f72
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The once gorgeous wetlands were infested with crows picking at decaying "
"remains. Bodies of soldiers fallen in battle continually washed up on the shores of coastal "
"villages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫当地的湿地原本是非常美丽的，⟪k:5⟫现在却成了啄食死尸的乌鸦的乐园。⟪k:6⟫因"
"战争而亡的腐烂死尸，⟪k:7⟫接连不断地被海浪冲到这个海边小镇上——"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d774526d63437397a72d11e724c84981ccc09fd308b232946b36d2d282af047a
#. default-sha256: 70c66b107bb334c9b53eb98ccf2b9d99e292612b9f0ea65676e300b93fa47eeb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people wanted nothing more than for the curtain to draw on that deeply political contest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫人们期盼着这场政治战争早日结束。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83ab24923a85b438f5cf10564ce00795741763ecc5c1d13864f61e768285ad2a
#. default-sha256: a6b2d05611bc084616fb68279ba4564fe725846853410821d67f635fe5494160
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And when it finally did, the kingdom, with its richly fertile shores, was stripped of its "
"independence, beginning a new era under new rule."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫最终，⟪k:1⟫这个土地肥沃的临海王国，⟪k:2⟫以被剥夺自治权为代价结束了战争。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f85ca55f59a4c3f4549f953864be840c37c55b6e38fb00dd1219ba98140938e8
#. default-sha256: 3564665f64d29d65ff612ef01baab10e61cf4208141a8380afc854b2165e2ae9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The people were exhausted, their spirits wasted away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫马疲人倦，⟪k:1⟫生灵涂炭。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 472fde22882fc24ed1d64d8ce565dd0d174d67574c37f1b6db1e5b8520d5ee26
#. default-sha256: a7a8cf32690da3b4bf3f9c7020979c0b472a8f7789d4e788464c42083fe1b0c7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the splendor of the ocean and sky did nothing to help."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫明明蓝天碧海是如此美丽……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89b554e46c411b95d40bb9e83869beddb6d32c1a405fef170253b9e6b0010215
#. default-sha256: 3cf1ec5d6a4eff4fd11b2778e97a61d70d2cabea7ddf9da02c40c685789a2bdc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In my mind, the beast was emblematic of the times—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫emaciated and enveloped in the "
"scent of blood."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆认为，⟪k:1⟫这个「野兽」恰是时代的象征。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫这头饥饿的野兽散发出的血臭味。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31cb270e340a072a310b9c8029342a6eaa4e0f50a983606df006841b6ba9cf31
#. default-sha256: 67a0f616a966212c4d52e6ca62ec6eb755a6c355cdc78f4b00e33bcd63464506
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the war came to an end. ⟪k:1⟫Thus the beast did not have to remain a beast, I thought."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是战争已经结束了。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫所以……⟪k:3⟫是不是野兽也可以变为人了呢？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a191e98b78c627b64afac61c50834e73e7760e08568f1ce3b737107e65e4234
#. default-sha256: 19c29200d2de8a2c194f6847fe7ea11f599b4d6952c44a976d3c4cb002c82787
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did he?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫您认为呢？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e45490bf5cc39e7862623f2c68c73081a015bb8a1d40eda193aca4310d30f40e
#. default-sha256: e223d3015f4f1b2b5992bbea6b83108cbd32d72031306cfd6a7eeb0a3ee07770
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And so, I endeavored to make the beast more human-like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫下仆试着把野兽驯化得具有人性。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48fbc3037170314d9b50351fad42e3a1c011b43ee0c6da2b79c5c40ae30bb790
#. default-sha256: 1df247a47ebab56efe05d1a28ce67f8a047f18f570b88b630850037b87dbf949
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫First, I needed to do something about his appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫首先要修整他的外表。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9156acb9491b6234b5668c3fc4d853b9b3d2050052dcd5a02650f3ecb255b83d
#. default-sha256: b5d4b8833582130d4be3757b28b186c2d82d58a0634508ab3e522d6a18526f84
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would draw a bath, scrub away all the filth, and dress him in clothing left in the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆烧了洗澡水，⟪k:1⟫将他的身体清理干净。⟪k:2⟫然后给他穿上留在馆里的衣服。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44f2c0bd13e94c82318ea5d924cbdedb446e920c787a59643f84b1a3eaa0acea
#. default-sha256: a4e0df72bb5cb630d11c1b683070d52b9b1e66ff040a2816102a41ba0b23aafb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, having sat unused for fifty years, the majority of garments had been devoured by "
"insects and were of little use."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可是，⟪k:1⟫如今已经过了五十年，⟪k:2⟫大部分衣服早已被虫子咬坏，⟪k:3⟫不能再穿了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c24eabe4aa2e6d377f4e155fcad675d4d747d17c658cd3040b4d4c62d1702ba
#. default-sha256: 80efbf2fd697e618014294e684f449c5361857145e77978c21c595c3e808a569
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I searched the mansion top to bottom for anything the beast could wear, heated up some "
"coals, and set to work ironing what I found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆挑出野兽能穿的衣服，⟪k:1⟫准备好炭火，⟪k:2⟫辛辛苦苦地用熨斗抚平衣服。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 770c45f57a9452d8591c86b56cba547df116af208a41bc813aefa5c1b955c66b
#. default-sha256: 2b7d70a8bc8fa55bb48c91c611beb28b706f48b2536f83cf6a8fc811d6437669
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, steam irons had not yet been invented. We used plates of iron heated with coals."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因为那时还没有蒸汽熨斗，⟪k:1⟫所以用炭加热过的铁板就是熨斗。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30bc57b45e227dbd3b49ca894f44dab1cd9e7372f27e3b132a2ea746222b81bc
#. default-sha256: cef1b61408d840c2634a0c00749ce2df3c6daeb05129bfdd9d9490d327398d1a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They somewhat resembled kettles."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫外表看起来和锅差不多吧。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaaff1029e746c60707e2f10e020ca065177d7c0f3388ae7456a0de34af48d17
#. default-sha256: 264ecc10c61337d88a5f65707c108502eab3eb095058cadb8b0f91d6c7f7b98c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I even prepared meals for the beast, in order to teach him proper table "
"manners."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫下仆还记得怎么做饭，⟪k:4⟫于是就为野兽准备了料理。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23482b0da4cafa607afa8c294d9f8b32c47a8ea5fe7bc72fb5e3f968475e6929
#. default-sha256: 5d9e0fb44c805b621c4c81e556e54581bb89371b3ee93df7cb46d24b0002b2c6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although, with the mansion in a nearly uninhabitable state of disarray, there was only so "
"much I could do in the kitchen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽说要做饭，⟪k:1⟫但因为当时的馆凋敝得根本无法住人，⟪k:2⟫所以厨房也用着不顺手。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed16cce167298afe3874e8e33d4ba347143101527da33c68c02cb344be8c2293
#. default-sha256: f0edf0bf125ecb63c31c8da5225107fd313b4067f31749d860f6374053b9c63c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the only supplies I had to work with were what was left in the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫食材也只有储藏室里剩下的东西。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A48236E7_2B15_4071_9C06_0EBE6C14F04B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7653edadc1c060a0ad71d30abe845d529152cceb92ae2b1988a51b8301da83e0
#. default-sha256: c4be5e7de39c876c6809e2677b54f57d21d997305349a28664787bcc1b89eb03
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A48236E7_2B15_4071_9C06_0EBE6C14F04B"
msgid ""
